WEBVTT

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:31.596
To solve that problem,

00:05:31.636 --> 00:05:34.916
we developed a new framework
to optimize multiple benefits.

00:05:35.596 --> 00:05:37.356
Picking which areas to protect

00:05:37.396 --> 00:05:40.716
depends on how much we value
the different objectives.

00:05:41.156 --> 00:05:46.036
We found that if we gave the same weight
to each biodiversity, food and carbon,

00:05:46.116 --> 00:05:50.156
we would want to protect
the right 45 percent of the ocean

00:05:50.196 --> 00:05:51.836
to maximize the three benefits.

00:05:52.676 --> 00:05:56.476
We also found that even
if we didn't value biodiversity,

00:05:56.516 --> 00:06:00.876
the minimum amount of ocean
we would protect would be 30 percent.